PHASE 6 — User identity conclusion
=============================================================================
  Code trace (src/middleware.ts:185):
    key = 'rl:general:' + ip  (IP-only, no userId)

  This is an architectural fact — the rate-limit key does NOT incorporate
  the authenticated user's identity. Two users on the same IP share a bucket.

  Classification:
    NO_USER_IDENTITY_IN_KEY = CODE_VERIFIED
  Type: abuse-policy weakness (not automatically a bypass vulnerability)
  (Mitigating factor: search requires authentication, so the attacker must
   have a valid session. But the bucket is per-IP, not per-user.)

